      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cast equiatomic HfNbTaTiZr has a yield strength of 163–530 MPa at 1000 °C.",
      "field": "baseline",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Adding 1–3 at.% Al to equiatomic HfNbTaTiZr will improve its high-temperature oxidation resistance.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Al addition will produce a thin, continuous Al2O3 surface layer.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed Al2O3 layer will act as a barrier to oxygen diffusion.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Restricting oxygen diffusion will reduce oxidation of the underlying alloy.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Restricting oxygen diffusion will reduce degradation of the underlying alloy.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The oxidation-resistance improvement will occur during exposure to air at 1000 °C for up to 100 hours.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Al-modified alloy will retain useful mechanical performance without a significant sacrifice relative to untreated cast HfNbTaTiZr.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "After 100 hours of exposure, the Al-modified alloy will retain 80–90% of its yield strength.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
